Package: igm4ahp
Type: Package
Title: Inverse Gram Matrix Methods for Analytic Hierarchy Process
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Kevin Kam Fung", "Yuen",, email = "kevinkf.yuen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements exact, closed-form Inverse Gram Matrix (IGM) prioritization 
    methods for Pairwise Reciprocal Matrices (PRMs) in the Analytic Hierarchy Process 
    (AHP) based on Yuen (2024) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2401.01190>. Derives closed-form 
    Weighted Least Squares (WLS) priority vectors via Pseudo-IGM (PIGM), element-form 
    Normalized-IGM (eNIGM), and augmented Lagrangian-IGM (lagrangeIGM) algorithms in O(n^3) 
    operations without iterative numerical solvers. Includes Saaty principal eigenvalue 
    utilities and consistency evaluation tools.
